{
  "version": "crew-knowledge-4",
  "note": "제작진 모드(B2)의 분야 정의와 규칙. 단계마다 고를 선택지는 crew_library/*.jsonl(수천~수만 개)에서 요청마다 검색해 채운다. 문장은 직접 작성했고 외부 사전을 복사하지 않았다(GPL 원본 DENO 와 분리).",
  "global_rules": [
    "The user's words come first: keep every subject, object, action, count, color, name, genre, style, era, mood, weather, season and place the user gave, and let them decide the look. A menu choice never overrides the user's words.",
    "Use positive phrasing only; never use no, not, without, avoid or never.",
    "Do not mention text, letters, logos, brand names or captions anywhere, and do not put any person in the picture unless the request names one.",
    "If the request names a purpose (poster, banner, thumbnail, ad), the purpose decides composition and brightness, and no menu choice may contradict it.",
    "Be inventive and varied: do not default to a dark premium studio look; use luxury or dark looks only when the request asks for them."
  ],
  "purpose_words": {
    "포스터": "poster: bright clear colors, one strong focal element, a clean horizon or axis, open empty space where a title could go (but no text)",
    "썸네일": "thumbnail: a large simple subject, high contrast, readable at a small size",
    "배너": "banner: wide composition with the subject on one side and open space on the other",
    "광고": "advertisement: the subject is the hero, polished lighting, clean uncluttered surroundings",
    "홍보": "promotion: inviting, bright, clearly shows the place or product being promoted",
    "표지": "cover: one centered or third-aligned subject with generous margin"
  },
